{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act43side_level_act43side_02_end","storyGroup":"act43side","storySort":5,"storyDependence":"act43side_level_act43side_02_beg","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"AD-2","storyName":"排演一出悲剧","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"场景喷绘师蒂比举办的观影会中途，谢莉收到一条讯息后匆忙离开，最终死于仓库的冷库之中。与此同时，潜入剧组办公室的卢西恩发现了被刻意隐藏的另一个秘密。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act43side/level_act43side_02_end","avgTag":"行动后","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act43side_02","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":3,"next":5,"characters":["蒂比","谢莉","莫伊拉","Miss.Christine","迈克尔","卢西恩","？？？"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":4},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_oldtv","layer":"1","id":5},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e6/Avg_bg_62_g6_proproom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":6},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_oldtvelectricity","loop":"true","channel":"c","id":7},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.5","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":8},{"type":"text","text":"深夜，本应空无一人的道具间传来细碎的声响和被压抑的悲鸣。","id":9},{"type":"text","text":"幽暗的角落里，道具假人没有五官的面孔被闪烁的荧光打亮。","id":10},{"type":"text","text":"蒂比抱着靠枕缩在沙发里，持刀的凶手发出邪恶的笑声，刀尖闪着刺眼的白光，下一秒——","id":11},{"type":"bgeffect","id":12},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"c","fadetime":"0","id":13},{"type":"dialog","id":14},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#8$1","id":15},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_orangefall","id":16},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":17},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"啊——","id":18,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d8/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"0.5","id":19},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1836_1#3$1","id":20},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":21},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"啊——","id":22,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1e/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#1$1","id":23},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"......","id":24,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":25},{"type":"dialog","id":26},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":27},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_normal_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":28,"musicid":0},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#1$1","id":29},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"经典！震撼！不愧是我最喜欢的恐怖电影，哪怕是三十多年前的小成本制作，跟现在的新片比起来也毫不逊色！","id":30,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1836_1#2$1","id":31},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"呼......还是看恐怖片比较能发泄情绪，我好像没有那么焦虑了。谢谢你的邀请，小蒂比。","id":32,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ec/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#1$1","id":33},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"大声喊出来舒服多了吧，谢莉小姐？我就说你不是故意打断拍摄的，只是最近神经太紧绷了。","id":34,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1836_1#2$1","id":35},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"嗯，虽然还有一些问题没解决......但今晚就让我忘记它们吧。接下来我们看什么？","id":36,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ec/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#1$1","id":37},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"应有尽有，恐怖电影之夜才刚刚开始呢！","id":38,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#2$1","id":39},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"咦？莫丽，你怎么一直不说话，是不喜欢这部电影吗？","id":40,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8e/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#9$1","id":41},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"我在想......","id":42,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"电影里出现的武器刀刃太过轻薄，如果是我就干脆设计更特殊的武器，在侧面加上血槽，视觉上的冲击力也更强！","id":43,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#8$1","id":44},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"别再想工作了！莫丽！你是不是跟谢莉小姐待太久了！","id":45,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d8/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":46},{"type":"charslot","id":47},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4198_christ_1#2$1","duration":"1","id":48},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":49},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_MCcat_1","id":50},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Miss.Christine","text":"喵~","id":51,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_4198_christ_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#1$1","id":52},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"欸？你怎么在这里呀，神秘的小家伙。","id":53,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4198_christ_1#1$1","id":54},{"type":"text","text":"美丽的生物缓步走到两个小女孩中间，展示般地伸了一个懒腰，端坐在沙发前。","id":55},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#1$1","id":56},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"莫丽你看，她好像真的很喜欢我们欸。那就跟我们一起看电影吧！可别被吓到了哦。","id":57,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":58},{"type":"charslot","id":59},{"type":"playsound","key":"$phonevibration","id":60},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":61},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#4$1","id":62},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"嗯？谁的终端响了？莫丽，是你的吗？","id":63,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6e/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#3$1","id":64},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"不是啊。","id":65,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1836_1#4$1","id":66},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"......","id":67,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3b/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1836_1#1$1","id":68},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"抱歉，我得......先走了。","id":69,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":70},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walkfast","id":71},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"200,0","duration":"1","afrom":"1","ato":"0","id":72},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":73},{"type":"charslot","id":74},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#4$1","id":75},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"她的脸色好差，不会是因为白天的事被格蕾塔女士问责了吧？","id":76,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d4/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#9$1","id":77},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"莫丽，明天我们再帮她分担一些工作吧？谢莉小姐看上去真的很疲惫。","id":78,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#9$1","id":79},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"嗯。","id":80,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#1$1","id":81},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"来！我们接着看电影，下一部恐怖片拿过最佳设计奖哦，置景、道具和武器都做得非常酷......","id":82,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":83},{"type":"text","text":"荧光闪烁，两个女孩再次沉浸在新的惊悚故事里，丝毫没注意到脚边的Miss.Christine也已悄无声息地离开。","id":84},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":85},{"type":"dialog","id":86},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":87},{"type":"charslot","id":88},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/52/Avg_bg_62_g1_setting_lobby.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":89},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":90},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_darkness_03_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":91,"musicid":1},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walkfast","id":92},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"-200,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1","name":"avg_npc_1836_1#6$1","id":93},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":94},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"......","id":95,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":96},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"100,0","duration":"0.5","id":97},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"100,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"0.5","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#1$1","id":98},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":99},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"15","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"10","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":100},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1836_1#6$1","id":101},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"100,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"0.5","id":102},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown2","volume":"0.6","id":103},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":104},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":105},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"谢莉？你不是应该在跟小蒂比她们看电影吗，急匆匆的是要到哪里去？","id":106,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2e/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":107},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1836_1#4$1","focus":"all","id":108},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":109},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":110},{"type":"text","text":"语气亲昵的男子注意到谢莉的右手紧紧抓着终端。","id":111},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":112},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"哦，我知道了......突然收到了约会邀请？","id":113,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/92/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"一会儿可别对对方露出这样沉重的表情啊，他会伤心的。","id":114,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/92/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1836_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":115},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"跟你无关。","id":116,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":117},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"你的嘴唇在颤抖。你很冷，还是说在害怕？","id":118,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/92/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"可怜的小人儿，你也跟我一样，被道尔顿的意外吓坏了是不是？","id":119,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/92/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"别忧心了，有你这样认真的统筹在，我相信接下来一切都会很顺利的。来，让我给你个拥抱，你会暖和一些......","id":120,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/92/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":121},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-100,0","duration":"1","id":122},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":123},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"0.6","id":124},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.2","xstrength":"15","ystrength":"5","vibrato":"10","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":125},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"50,0","duration":"0.3","id":126},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"-100,0","posto":"100,0","duration":"0.5","id":127},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":128},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1836_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":129},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"“跟你一样”？","id":130,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"我从你的甜言蜜语里可听不到半点恐惧。","id":131,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1836_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":132},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"你的忘性已经大到能将五年前发生的事从脑子里抹得一干二净了吗？","id":133,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7f/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"我没办法“跟你一样”没心没肺......别忘了，你也要为当初的坠亡事故负责。","id":134,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7f/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":135},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"......","id":136,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":137},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1836_1#1$1","id":138},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walkfast","id":139},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"300,0","duration":"1","afrom":"1","ato":"0","id":140},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":141},{"type":"dialog","id":142},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":143},{"type":"charslot","id":144},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":145},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/16/Avg_bg_62_g13_directorstudio.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":146},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":147},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":148},{"type":"text","text":"深夜，二楼的办公室突兀地亮起灯。","id":149},{"type":"text","text":"一张办公桌上，文件夹中的纸质材料被整齐地收纳着，几乎看不出有人使用的痕迹。","id":150},{"type":"text","text":"而另一张桌子上，通告单杂乱无章，布满修改痕迹，似乎字迹的主人正被什么困扰。","id":151},{"type":"text","text":"一个高挑的身影在办公桌附近翻找着什么，动作精准利落，没发出一丝声响。","id":152},{"type":"dialog","id":153},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":154},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":155},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"在这。","id":156,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":157},{"type":"text","text":"碎纸机有近期使用过的痕迹。","id":158},{"type":"text","text":"卢西恩打开废纸盒，在大量碎纸条中捡出了触感特别的几条——那些不是剧组的打印纸。","id":159},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","id":160},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"“特里蒙大学”......“环境监测”......签字是......格蕾塔。","id":161,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"这就是谢莉所说的“奇怪的文件”。","id":162,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":163},{"type":"text","text":"他感觉自己的肩膀被轻轻推了一下，像一声认同。但办公室内除自己外再无旁人。","id":164},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#11$1","id":165},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"欢迎回来，Miss.Christine。","id":166,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":167},{"type":"charslot","id":168},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4198_christ_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":169},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":170},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#12$1","id":171},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"最近你散步的次数变多了，是找到什么感兴趣的东西了吗？","id":172,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4198_christ_1#1$1","id":173},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Miss.Christine","text":"这里比想象中更有意思。","id":174,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_4198_christ_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#5$1","id":175},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"没错，我也发现了意料之外的东西。","id":176,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ea/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":177},{"type":"dialog","id":178},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":179},{"type":"charslot","id":180},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":181},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d0/Avg_bg_bg_warehouse.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":182},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":183},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":184},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$suspenseful_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act15d0d0/m_avg_suspenseful_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":185,"musicid":2},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1836_1#4$1","duration":"1","id":186},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":187},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"......别多想......你只是来确认究竟是谁的恶作剧......","id":188,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3b/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"是你亲眼看着那个号码作废，不可能是那个人......不可能......","id":189,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3b/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":190},{"type":"text","text":"谢莉努力平复着自己的心情，观影时刻意遗忘的恐惧和焦虑此刻再度淹没了她。","id":191},{"type":"text","text":"“去仓库，去赎你的罪。”","id":192},{"type":"text","text":"终端屏幕在寂静的仓库里微微发光，发信人一栏里跳动着谢莉熟悉却难以面对的名字——“劳拉”。","id":193},{"type":"dialog","id":194},{"type":"charslot","id":195},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.2","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":196},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_glass_break","id":197},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":198},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1836_1#5$1","id":199},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"谁在那里！","id":200,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7f/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"不要再装神弄鬼了，我现在很清楚这条消息不是我的幻觉！你到底要干什么......","id":201,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7f/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":202},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"你知道什么？！","id":203,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7f/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":204},{"type":"text","text":"无人回应。黑暗吞没了老旧仓库里所有残存的声音。","id":205},{"type":"text","text":"细小的电流声簌簌作响，远处货架上的顶灯倏地亮起。","id":206},{"type":"text","text":"诡异而充满诱惑，谢莉控制不住地向光源走去。","id":207},{"type":"dialog","id":208},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1848_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","afrom":"0","ato":"0.8","id":209},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":210},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"谢莉小姐。","id":211,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_npc_1848_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1836_1#6$1","id":212},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"......劳拉......是你吗......","id":213,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":214},{"type":"text","text":"谢莉再次颤抖起来，她无法分辨这声音究竟来自仓库深处，还是自己的臆想。","id":215},{"type":"text","text":"她怔怔地向前走着，恍然如回到了五年前的摄影棚，悲剧一幕的开场。","id":216},{"type":"dialog","id":217},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1848_1#1$1","afrom":"0.8","ato":"0.8","id":218},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"谢莉，谢莉！我又新加了一场戏，需要用一下威亚，你可以帮我准备一下吗？","id":219,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_npc_1848_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1836_1#1$1","id":220},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"狂妄......自傲......目中无人......你是个在蓝卡坞刚刚起步的新人，怎么敢......","id":221,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1848_1#1$1","afrom":"0.8","ato":"0.8","id":222},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"道尔顿先生说他已经征得了导演的同意，这个应该是已经定下了的......","id":223,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_npc_1848_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1836_1#1$1","id":224},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"风头正盛的道尔顿想教训你，你却还误以为他是真的想帮你......结果呢，你满意了吗？","id":225,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1848_1#1$1","afrom":"0.8","ato":"0.8","id":226},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"他还没来吗......我都在威亚上吊了好几个小时了，腿和胳膊估计已经磨破皮了......谢莉，你能帮我问问他们吗？","id":227,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_npc_1848_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1836_1#1$1","id":228},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"我只是“一个统筹”而已，只配帮你准备威亚和设备，保证它们是......安全的......","id":229,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":230},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1848_1#1$1","afrom":"0.8","ato":"0.8","id":231},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":232},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"你做到了吗？","id":233,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_npc_1848_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":234},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":235},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":236},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":237},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":238},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1836_1#6$1","duration":"1","id":239},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":240},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":241},{"type":"text","text":"谢莉走到货架前，灯光明晃晃地照着一个黑色的防尘袋，她知道里面是什么。","id":242},{"type":"text","text":"不要打开，谢莉，不要。","id":243},{"type":"dialog","id":244},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"m","id":245},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_zipper_normal","loop":"true","channel":"v","id":246},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":247},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"v","fadetime":"0.5","id":248},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$drift_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_drift_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":249,"musicid":3},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"20","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":250},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1836_1#3$1","id":251},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"！！！","id":252,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1e/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":253},{"type":"text","text":"防尘袋里装着一套老旧的威亚设备，挂钩和吊索磨损严重，保护带也几近断裂。","id":254},{"type":"text","text":"黑色的布料上附着着一些深色的斑块。","id":255},{"type":"text","text":"那是劳拉的血。","id":256},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":257},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1836_1#5$1","id":258},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"不！你不可能知道！","id":259,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7f/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1836_1#4$1","id":260},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"你是我的幻觉！你不可能还活着！对了......疼痛......钢笔，我带了钢笔......","id":261,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3b/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":262},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_daggerslow","loop":"true","channel":"a","id":263},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.2","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"20","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":264},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.2","r":"0.7","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":265},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"a","fadetime":"0","id":266},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1836_1#4$1","id":267},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"嘶——","id":268,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3b/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1848_1#1$1","afrom":"0.8","ato":"0.8","id":269},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"......可悲。","id":270,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_npc_1848_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1836_1#4$1","id":271},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"为什么你还在......为什么没有用！","id":272,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3b/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1848_1#1$1","afrom":"0.8","ato":"0.8","id":273},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"五年前的事故，究竟是意外还是谋杀？","id":274,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_npc_1848_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1836_1#5$1","id":275},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":276},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"是意外......是意外！要不是道尔顿故意为难你，根本没有后面的惨剧！","id":277,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7f/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1848_1#1$1","afrom":"0.8","ato":"0.8","id":278},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"为什么不检查我身上的设备？","id":279,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_npc_1848_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1836_1#4$1","id":280},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"我......","id":281,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3b/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":282},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1848_1#1$1","afrom":"0.8","ato":"0.8","id":283},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"为什么！","id":284,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_npc_1848_1$1.png"},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":285},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1836_1#5$1","id":286},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"因为我恨你！","id":287,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7f/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"我恨你自私、傲慢，把剧组的日程搞得一团糟，所有人的工作都被你无理取闹的要求影响！","id":288,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7f/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1836_1#1$1","id":289},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"道尔顿想要教训你，那当然好！我那天像往常一样检查威亚设备，却发现它正好到了更换日期......","id":290,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1836_1#4$1","id":291},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"我脑中滑过一个很小很小的念头，要是你出了意外彻底消失......","id":292,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3b/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"哈......哈哈......那不就更好了吗......","id":293,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3b/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":294},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"20","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":295},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"200,0","duration":"0.6","id":296},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown1","channel":"d","id":297},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":298},{"type":"charslot","id":299},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":300},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_doorclose","id":301},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":302},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snowstormflp","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","volume":"0","id":303},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.4","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":304},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":305},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_blizzard","layer":"1","id":306},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_icecage","layer":"2","id":307},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":308},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"5","block":"false","id":309},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_surfacefrozen","id":310},{"type":"text","text":"一只手将神情恍惚的谢莉推倒在地，她听到制冷剂在管道中汩汩流动，板结的冰霜在她身下缓缓开裂。","id":311},{"type":"text","text":"谢莉这才意识到，自己不知不觉走进了仓库尽头的冷库。","id":312},{"type":"text","text":"砸门？吼叫？谢莉已无力挣扎。","id":313},{"type":"text","text":"......","id":314},{"type":"text","text":"恐惧不知不觉消失了，她感到前所未有的放松。","id":315},{"type":"text","text":"......","id":316},{"type":"text","text":"......","id":317},{"type":"text","text":"死亡给了她所有谜题的答案。","id":318},{"type":"dialog","id":319},{"type":"dialog","id":320},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":321},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":322},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":323},{"type":"bgeffect","id":324},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":325},{"type":"image","id":326},{"type":"charslot","id":327}],"characters":["蒂比","谢莉","莫伊拉","Miss.Christine","迈克尔","卢西恩","？？？"]}